 "_comment_music_order": "TRAP (wi_audio._dispatch_music_event is FIRST-MATCH-WINS then returns): arena-keyed combat variants MUST precede the generic music_combat entry, or they never play. Field entries match map_changed payload {map}; sync-on-load matches kind=field + context==current_map. Sewers/deep_tunnels/cave maps are deliberately TRACKLESS -- silence is the dark-map mood; [Light] and the fights carry the audio there. All junkala_* tracks are CC0 (assets/LICENSES/junkala-cc0-music-verdict.md) and authored as seamless loops."
